      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONE KNEE NONI (1) hit the ground running from out wide with a scorching early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 3 length sixth (19.90) over 350m at this track. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings nine times from 18 starts. Should be very hard to beat this time. HYLAND AZULA (4) is mixing form and out of the placings last time but was a Bottom Up - Grade 5 winner three starts ago and moves to Box 4 this time where she has performed well. Rates a winning chance on best. SHREK'S BROTHER (7) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has been in the minors the last two runs, the latest finishing third (26.51) at Geelong. Will give a great sight again. BRUREE PAT (2) can finish much closer after missing a cheque at this track last start.",
